 is only the per-document source-quality input to the confidence-scorer's formula, not a substitute for confidence scoring itself - one of four weighted factors."}, {"id": "claude_hybrid_search_mechanism", "label": "Hybrid keyword+vector search with recency re-ranking", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kept as one call site inside search_corpus (no separate re-ranking MCP tool) to keep the POC's retrieval layer minimal per the plan's reduced Phase 1-2 scope; Azure AI Search / text-embedding-3-large is the intended production replacement, not built here."}, {"id": "claude_two_layer_retrieval_boundary", "label": "Retrieval boundary vs. corpus allowlist (two distinct layers)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The PreToolUse hook governs tool choice (open web vs approved corpus); the MCP server's own allowlist governs its own data (excludes BLG-999 via approved:false). Neither layer can see what the other catches, so removing either on the assumption the other covers it is unsafe."}, {"id": "claude_patent_agent_stretch", "label": "patent-agent / patent source_type (stretch, not built)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Patents are deliberately out of scope for this POC per the original plan ('avoid patents initially to reduce complexity') - no patent-agent and no patent source_type exist in the corpus; listed as a stretch item for a future phase."}, {"id": "claude_azure_ai_search_stretch", "label": "Azure AI Search / text-embedding-3-large backend (stretch)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_evaluation_harness_stretch", "label": "Retrieval/precision evaluation harness (stretch, not built)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not built since it needs a labeled query set, which is beyond a 3-source, 12-document demo corpus; would evaluate Recall@10, Precision@10, Citation Coverage, and Hallucination Rate."}], "edges": [{"source": "claude_helios_evidence_review_agent", "target": "claude_confidence_formula", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_helios_evidence_review_agent", "target": "claude_agents_confidence_scorer_confidence_scorer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_helios_evidence_review_agent", "target": "claude_agents_citation_validator_citation_validator", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_helios_evidence_review_agent", "target": "claude_agents_literature_agent_literature_agent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_helios_evidence_review_agent", "target": "claude_agents_trial_agent_trial_agent", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_helios_evidence_review_agent", "target": "claude_skills_evidence_review_skill_evidence_review", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLA